"⚠️ Overlaps other sessions' reservations (coordinate via send_message first):" = "⚠️ 与其他会话的预留重叠（建议先用 send_message 协调）：";
"Nothing to release." = "没有可释放的预留。";
"Released {length} reservations: {released}" = "已释放 {length} 处预留：{released}";
"Released {length} reservation: {released}" = "已释放 {length} 处预留：{released}";
"No file reservations in {root}." = "{root} 当前没有文件预留。";
"File reservations in {root} ({length}):\n" = "{root} 的文件预留（{length}）：\n";
"No new messages in the inbox." = "信箱里没有新消息。";
"Unknown tool: {name}" = "未知工具：{name}";
"cc-pets CC Bridge: exchange messages with other Claude Code / Codex terminal sessions on this machine. " = "cc-pets CC Bridge：与本机其他 Claude Code / Codex 终端会话互发消息。";
"When the user mentions cc-bridge, bridge, pet, desktop pet, 桌宠, cc-pets, cross-session / cross-terminal messages, " = "当用户提到 cc-bridge、bridge、pet、桌宠、cc-pets、跨会话 / 跨终端消息、";
"“message another session / terminal / Claude / Codex”, or names a session or tty (e.g. ttys003), " = "“给另一个会话 / 终端 / Claude / Codex 发消息”，或提到某个会话名、tty（如 ttys003）时，";
"use this server's tools directly; there's no need to look up bridge usage in project files. " = "直接使用本服务器的工具，不需要在项目文件里查找 bridge 的用法。";
