"Usage: cc-pets [command]\n\n  cc-pets                    Start the pet (prefers the copy installed in ~/Applications)\n  cc-pets install            Install or repair the shell / Claude Code / Codex integrations\n  cc-pets uninstall          Remove the integrations and restore the status line\n  cc-pets uninstall --purge  Also delete the app, app data and preferences (asks first; keeps pets and lines in ~/.cc-pets)\n  cc-pets uninstall-app      Only delete ~/Applications/CC Pets.app\n  cc-pets build              Rebuild\n  cc-pets clean              Clear caches (quit the pet first)\n  cc-pets doctor             Check the installation and integrations, with suggested fixes\n  cc-pets open [page]        Open the main window (pages: overview, sessions, usage, pet, alerts, general, diagnostics)\n  cc-pets paths [--json]     List where settings, caches and data live, and their sizes\n  cc-pets pet <command>      Manage pet sprites; see cc-pets pet help\n  cc-pets bridge <command>   CC Bridge cross-session messaging; see cc-pets bridge --help\n  cc-pets --status           Print the current Codex quota\n  cc-pets --history          Print quota history (JSON)\n  cc-pets --foreground       Run the pet in the foreground (for debugging)\n  cc-pets -v, --version      Show the version\n  cc-pets -h, --help         Show this help\n\ncodex-with-pet / claude-with-pet start the pet along with the CLI." = "用法：cc-pets [命令]\n\n  cc-pets                    启动桌宠（优先使用 ~/Applications 里安装的版本）\n  cc-pets install            安装或修复 shell / Claude Code / Codex 集成\n  cc-pets uninstall          移除集成并恢复 status line\n  cc-pets uninstall --purge  同时删除 App、应用数据和偏好（会先确认；保留 ~/.cc-pets 的素材与台词）\n  cc-pets uninstall-app      只删除 ~/Applications/CC Pets.app\n  cc-pets build              重新构建\n  cc-pets clean              清理缓存（需先退出桌宠）\n  cc-pets doctor             检查安装与各项集成是否正常，并给出修复建议\n  cc-pets open [页面]        打开主窗口（页面：overview、sessions、usage、pet、alerts、general、diagnostics）\n  cc-pets paths [--json]     列出配置、缓存与数据的存放位置和大小\n  cc-pets pet <命令>         管理桌宠素材，详见 cc-pets pet help\n  cc-pets bridge <命令>      CC Bridge 跨会话消息，详见 cc-pets bridge --help\n  cc-pets --status           输出 Codex 当前额度\n  cc-pets --history          输出额度历史（JSON）\n  cc-pets --foreground       在前台运行桌宠（调试用）\n  cc-pets -v, --version      显示版本\n  cc-pets -h, --help         显示本帮助\n\ncodex-with-pet / claude-with-pet 会在启动 CLI 的同时拉起桌宠。";
